sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GHA as GitHub Actions job<br/>concurrency: gke-qa-api
    participant WIF as Workload Identity Federation
    participant BRK as Intermediate service<br/>(Cloud Run function)
    participant GKE as GKE · authorized networks
    participant REC as Reconciler<br/>(every 15 min)

    Note over GHA: waits if another job holds the gke-qa-api group
    GHA->>WIF: OIDC token (exact repo + environment)
    WIF-->>GHA: preview or deploy identity<br/>WITHOUT container.clusters.update
    GHA->>BRK: open(runner ip /32)
    BRK->>BRK: validates /32, records run_id
    BRK->>GKE: adds gha-<run_id>-<epoch>
    GHA->>GKE: terramate run -- tofu plan / apply<br/>(helm, kubernetes)
    alt final step if: always()
        GHA->>BRK: close(ip)
        BRK->>GKE: removes the entry
    else runner died
        REC->>GKE: removes entries older than 60 min
    end
